  "prefLabel": "Plc 2102.05 Neutral evaluation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2102.05 “Neutral evaluation” means the review and evaluation of each party’s position, and the underlying support for that position, by a neutral who evaluates the information and provides an opinion, orally and in writing, that contains a suggested settlement or disposition and the reasons therefor.\n\nSource. #14331, eff 8-20-25, EXPIRES: 8-20-35",
